# Guidelight Matrix: "{2}, {T}: Target Vehicle you control becomes an artifact creature until end of turn." Turn 1 Bot1
# casts Matrix (Sol Ring's {C}{C}; the enters trigger draws Memnite) and Smuggler's Copter, and has nothing left: the
# ability is refused for want of mana. On turn 3, with Sol Ring's two mana (the pool empty right after) and Bot1's second
# Memnite still on the stack (no sorcery-speed limit on this ability), the Copter becomes an artifact creature
# (still a Vehicle, so Types lists Artifact; Creature) with no crew, and attacks Bot2 for 3. The ability is refused
# for Bot1's Memnite (a creature, not a Vehicle) and Bot2's own Smuggler's Copter (not "you control"). The Copter
# is not a creature again on turn 5.

